<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#VocalLine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Typed lyrics turned into phonemes and notes for a formant voice to sing. The phoneme path uses CC0 data only."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#VocalLine> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#VocalLine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "vocal line"@en .
