<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#FormantVoice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A synthesised voice built from formants, the resonances that make vowels. It can sing a vocal line with no recorded voice involved."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#FormantVoice> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#FormantVoice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "formant voice"@en .
