<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#Vocoder> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An effect that imposes the spectral shape of one signal (the modulator, usually a voice) onto another (the carrier, usually a synth or a deck)."@en .
