<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-filter-exit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Close a filter on the outgoing deck until it fades out of the mix."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-filter-exit> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-filter-exit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "filter exit"@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-filter-exit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PerformMove> .
