<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-phrase-sync> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Line the incoming deck up so its phrase starts on the outgoing deck's phrase boundary."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-phrase-sync> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-phrase-sync> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "phrase sync"@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-phrase-sync> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PerformMove> .
