<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-bass-swap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Cut the outgoing deck's low end and bring in the incoming deck's, so two basslines never sound together."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-bass-swap> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-bass-swap> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "bass swap"@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/move-bass-swap> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PerformMove> .
