<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PerformMove> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "stable" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PerformMove> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A gesture the app carries out for the DJ: a timed change to one or both decks."@en .
