<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PatternTransform> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PatternTransform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A function from patterns to patterns, such as transpose or reverse. Transforms compose and have an identity, so they form a monoid."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PatternTransform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "pattern transform"@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#PatternTransform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EngineConcept> .
