<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-ramp> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The change moves gradually from one value to another over a span of bars instead of jumping."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-ramp> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-ramp> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "ramp"@en .
