<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-for-n-bars> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-every-n-bars> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The change repeats at a fixed bar interval."@en .
