<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-on-next-phrase> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The change waits for the next phrase boundary, so it lands on the beat the listener expects."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-on-next-phrase> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#status> "in-development" .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/concept/timing-on-next-phrase> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "on next phrase"@en .
