<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/scale/major> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The seven-note major scale: whole, whole, half, whole, whole, whole, half."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/family/chill> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Slow, low-energy genres with a narrow dynamic range."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/family/jazz> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Jazz-derived genres. Songs alternate theme sections with solos."@en .
