<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A linear net that fires mute and unmute actions at section boundaries, which is how a song structure plays out."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Control net"@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#ControlNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EngineNet> .
