<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EngineNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Petri net the sequencer executes to make sound."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EngineNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Engine net"@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EngineNet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#MusicConcept> .
