<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EuclideanRhythm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "K pulses spread as evenly as possible over N steps, then rotated."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EuclideanRhythm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Euclidean rhythm"@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#EuclideanRhythm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#MusicConcept> .
