<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#SectionProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "What a section means in one family: which roles play and how much energy it carries."@en .
<https://ontology.bitwrap.io/ns#SectionProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Section profile"@en .
